sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Manager
  participant A as Your phone app
  participant Q as On-device queue
  participant G as Microsoft Graph
  participant L as SharePoint lists
  participant F as Flow: on new EOD
  participant O as Outlook / Teams
  M->>A: Fill EOD (draft saved on device)
  A->>A: Live totals with the same formulas the flow uses
  M->>A: Submit
  A->>Q: Queue submission (works with no signal)
  Q->>G: When online: create Trading day + child items (signed in via MSAL)
  G->>L: Items written (Site + Date unique key blocks duplicates)
  L-->>F: "When an item is created" trigger (standard connector)
  F->>F: Recalculate totals, check cash variance, look up target
  F->>L: Write official totals, status = Submitted (or flag problems)
  alt Urgent maintenance entered
    F->>L: Create work order
  end
  F->>O: EOD summary email to finance & managers
  A->>G: Refresh: show official totals and status
